Description: distraction-free Markdown editor (ghostwriter fork)
 mdwriter is a personal fork of ghostwriter, a distraction-free Markdown
 editor with a live HTML preview, theme creation, focus and full-screen
 modes, live word count, and document navigation.
 .
 This fork adds a preview-first layout (rendered preview by default, source
 editor toggled with Ctrl+Shift+E), import of Visual Studio Code color themes
 (built-in and extension themes), and VS Code-matching default fonts.
 .
 It installs as its own application and can be installed alongside the
 stock ghostwriter package.
